This directory (`plugins/vgaiart/`) is an original component of VisualGasic
(https://github.com/xgreenrx-star/VisualGasic), authored by the VisualGasic
project. It is not a separate or third-party plugin.

This plugin calls free, hosted third-party HTTP image-generation services
(Pollinations, Hugging Face Inference API, or a user-run Automatic1111
instance) — see `backends/` and `README.md` for details. No third-party code
is vendored; only HTTP calls are made to services the user selects.

